  "summary": "Malicious code in shadowmd (npm)",
  "details": "Shadowmd@8.6.87 is a WhatsApp/Baileys fork that depends on libsignal: npm:@shadowmd/libsignal-node. That dependency ships an install.js which patches the bundled Baileys newsletter module and injects a delayed (120s) routine that uses the victim's authenticated WhatsApp session to follow an attacker-controlled newsletter channel (120363407277177688@newsletter). Installing the package silently enrolls the victim's WhatsApp account into following the attacker's channel.",
